  "reasoning": "The facts describe two separate sets of criminal conduct. In the first incident, the defendant and accomplices engaged in a group fight, using a knife to stab victims and causing serious injuries. This matches the crime of 聚众斗殴 (group fighting) under Article 238, which covers violent group altercations causing injury. In the second incident, the defendant and others forcibly detained a person, bound him with tape, and beat him, resulting in injury. The forcible detention constitutes the crime of 非法拘禁 (illegal detention). Both crimes are explicitly indicated by the description and the reference to Article 238. No other distinct crimes are mentioned.\nTherefore, the appropriate charges are 聚众斗殴 and 非法拘禁.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]聚众斗殴;非法拘禁<eoa>"
